# scenario: send-stuck
# A send that sits in Broadcasting: the dialog is locked at first, then may be
# closed (2 s here, 30 s normally), and the outcome still arrives as a toast.
click Spending
click Send
type "Lightning invoice or on-chain address" lnbc1200u1demo
click Review
expect Total
click Send
expect Broadcasting
expect-locked
shot locked
expect You can close this; the result will appear when it arrives
shot unlocked
close-dialog
expect-not Total
expect Payment sent
shot toast
